  {
   "kind": "talk",
   "cam": "dash",
   "muteApp": true,
   "say": "Okay, so here you can see the Yarrow dashboard. I've imported a very simple to-do app from GitHub, and you can see that there is zero tickets. It comes from GitHub issues, but you can use Jira, Linear or Trello.",
